1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Welcome to HAMSVIC Office — the smart estimation
platform for Indian government contractors.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Whether you work in electrical or civil construction,
HAMSVIC helps you build smarter and estimate faster.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Let's take a tour of the platform
and see what it can do.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
The landing page showcases key features —
smart estimates, workslips, bills, and project management.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:26,000
All powered by official government
Schedule of Rates from your state.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Login is simple and secure.
HAMSVIC uses passwordless OTP authentication.

7
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Enter your email, receive a six-digit code,
and you're in — no passwords to manage.

8
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,000
A one-time password is sent to your
registered email instantly.

9
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Enter the code and you're securely
logged into your account.

10
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:53,000
This is the Dashboard — your command center.
All modules are visible at a glance.

11
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Estimate, Workslip, Bill, Self-Formatted Forms,
Temporary Works, and AMC modules.

12
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Each module shows its subscription status
so you always know what's available.

13
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Let's create a new estimate.
First, select the work type.

14
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Choose Original Work for new construction
or Repair Work for maintenance jobs.

15
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Select your category — Electrical or Civil.
The system loads the correct SOR rates automatically.

16
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Browse the SOR groups to find the items
you need for your estimate.

17
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Each item includes the official government rate,
unit of measurement, and detailed description.

18
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Select items, set quantities, and the system
calculates everything automatically.

19
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:46,000
The Workslip module generates professional
measurement books from your saved estimates.

20
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:52,000
All measurements, rates, and calculations
are filled in automatically — saving hours of work.

21
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:58,000
The Bill module supports four bill types —
from First Part to Nth Part Bills.

22
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:04,000
The entire billing chain from Estimate to Workslip
to Bill is linked with sequential numbering.

23
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Self-Formatted Forms let you upload your own
Excel templates with placeholders.

24
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:16,000
Templates can be locked to prevent edits,
and automatic backups enable instant recovery.

25
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:22,000
The Saved Works manager organizes all your
documents in a professional file system.

26
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:28,000
Create folders, manage documents, and generate
workslips or bills with a single click.

27
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:34,000
Letter Settings auto-populate officer names,
designations, and addresses across all documents.

28
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Configure once and every forwarding letter
is generated with the correct details.

29
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:46,000
Flexible pricing starts at just 299 rupees
per month for individual modules.

30
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:52,000
The All Modules Bundle offers the best value.
Every module includes a free trial.

31
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:58,000
HAMSVIC Office transforms construction billing.
Estimates, workslips, bills — all automated.

32
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:04,000
Visit hamsvic.com to start your free trial.
Build Smarter, Estimate Faster.
